TI  - Evaluation of sludge quality in Indian sewage treatment plants to develop quality control indices.
AU  - Sude, Ganesh
AU  - Rajpal, Ankur
AU  - Tyagi, Vinay Kumar
AU  - Sharma, Kapil
AU  - Mutiyar, Pravin Kumar
AU  - Panday, B K
AU  - Pandey, R P
